<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Transport</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 17), Sorcerer (guild level 32)
Mana: 25
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast transport &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>Takes you, in a puff of green smoke, to a person, a creature, an object or a 
place anywhere in the world. It only works where you could also walk: within 
the same land, not across the sea. You can't leave a place that magic can't 
take you out of, nor arrive in one magic can't reach.
</p><p>Beware the rift: about one cast in twenty tears a hole in the powers of 
magic. All your mana is gone, and you may be thrown somewhere else, into the 
void, or something may come through the rift at you.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
